śrutadhanam|{thos pa'i nor} (Skt. śrutadhanam) the wealth of learning
tyāgadhanam|{gtong ba'i nor} (Skt. tyāgadhanam) the wealth of generosity
prajñādhanam|{shes rab kyi nor} (Skt. prajñādhanam) the wealth of wisdom
